   "id": 1,
   "plugin": "Core",
   "model": "Notes",
   "data": {
    "text": "ARCHETYPE\nPatch any CV (0 to 10 V) into a jack. 0 V is the item's From setting, 10 V its To.\n\nCV-CC 1: MIDI channel 4, CC 17 to 32\n   1 Enneagram type\n   2 Stabilizer to Catalyst\n   3 Reactive to Proactive\n   4 Conformist to Individualist\n   5 Altruistic to Self-serving\n   6 Cautious to Reckless\n   7 Surrender to Controlling\n   8 Idealist to Cynic\n   9 Open to Secretive\n  10 Emotional to Rational\n  11 Flexible to Rigid\n  12 Conflict-avoidant to Confrontational\n  13 Orderly to Chaotic\n  14 Honest to Deceptive\n  15 Ineffective to Highly capable\n  16 Security to Freedom\nCV-CC 2: MIDI channel 4, CC 33 to 48\n   1 External to Internal\n   2 Enneagram health\n   3 suite: Type 1: Reformer\n   4 suite: Type 2: Helper\n   5 suite: Type 3: Achiever\n   6 suite: Type 4: Individualist\n   7 suite: Type 5: Investigator\n   8 suite: Type 6: Loyalist\n   9 suite: Type 7: Enthusiast\n  10 suite: Type 8: Challenger\n  11 suite: Type 9: Peacemaker\n  12 pair: When a Reformer falls into stress, they look like an Individualist\n  13 pair: When a Reformer grows, they borrow from the Enthusiast\n  14 pair: When a Helper falls into stress, they look like a Challenger\n  15 pair: When a Helper grows, they borrow from the Individualist\n  16 pair: When an Achiever falls into stress, they look like a Peacemaker\nCV-CC 3: MIDI channel 4, CC 49 to 63\n   1 pair: When an Achiever grows, they borrow from the Loyalist\n   2 pair: When an Individualist falls into stress, they look like a Helper\n   3 pair: When an Individualist grows, they borrow from the Reformer\n   4 pair: When an Investigator falls into stress, they look like an Enthusiast\n   5 pair: When an Investigator grows, they borrow from the Challenger\n   6 pair: When a Loyalist falls into stress, they look like an Achiever\n   7 pair: When a Loyalist grows, they borrow from the Peacemaker\n   8 pair: When an Enthusiast falls into stress, they look like a Reformer\n   9 pair: When an Enthusiast grows, they borrow from the Investigator\n  10 pair: When a Challenger falls into stress, they look like an Investigator\n  11 pair: When a Challenger grows, they borrow from the Helper\n  12 pair: When a Peacemaker falls into stress, they look like a Loyalist\n  13 pair: When a Peacemaker grows, they borrow from the Achiever\n  14 pairs: Stress arrows\n  15 pairs: Growth arrows"
   },
